       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-RENDERMAN-CLAY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RENDERMAN-CLAY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SUBDIVISION-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STROKE-INVARIANCE-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BSSRDF-CONSERVE-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RENDERMAN-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RENDERMAN-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-RENDERMAN-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-RCP-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-RCP-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SUBDIV-AND-STROKE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-BSSRDF-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-RCP-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SUBDIV-AND-STROKE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SUBDIVISION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STROKE-INVARIANCE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-BSSRDF-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BSSRDF-CONSERVE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RENDERMAN-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-RCP-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SUBDIVISION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STROKE-INVARIANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-BSSRDF-CONSERVE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RENDERMAN-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-RENDERMAN-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-RCP-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-RCP-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-RCP-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-RCP-CODE.
